how to load external properties in spring boot

Spring Boot loads external properties using command-line arguments, environment variables, 
and external configuration files via spring.config.location or spring.config.additional-location. 
These external values override internal configurations based on priority.

in application.properties 
spring.config.import : file://c/test.properties   // location where you save your file

