how to map or bind config properties to java object

In modern Spring Boot, configuration properties are mapped to Java objects using @ConfigurationProperties, 
which provides type-safe binding, supports nested objects, lists, and validation, and works with both YAML 
and properties files. For best practice, immutable records are preferred in Spring Boot 3.x.
